@HOST = http://localhost
@ACCESS_TOKEN = CHANGEME
@BRAND_ID = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@INVOICE_ID = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Listar facturas de una marca
GET {{HOST}}/invoice?brandId={{BRAND_ID}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Detalle de factura con items
GET {{HOST}}/invoice/{{INVOICE_ID}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Descargar factura en PDF
GET {{HOST}}/invoice/{{INVOICE_ID}}/pdf HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Notas crédito de una factura
GET {{HOST}}/invoice/{{INVOICE_ID}}/credit-notes HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

# =============================================
# DIAN — Facturación electrónica
# =============================================

### Verificar si DIAN está configurado
GET {{HOST}}/dian/configured HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Enviar factura a la DIAN
POST {{HOST}}/dian/send/{{INVOICE_ID}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Consultar estado de factura ante la DIAN
GET {{HOST}}/dian/status/{{INVOICE_ID}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
